ays if someone is furry and white, they are nice. Bob is furry and white, so he is nice, which we already know. No conflict there.\n\nAlso, Charlie is blue and nice, so he's furry and smart, making him quiet as well. Fiona is blue, so she's furry and, if she's nice, she'd be smart and quiet. Harry is white, so he's blue, furry, and if he's nice, he's smart and quiet. But we don't know if Harry is nice or not, so his quietness is unknown.\n\nBut for Bob, all the necessary conditions are met. He's nice, smart, so he's quiet. Therefore, the statement \"Bob is quiet\" is true.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: A",
