ite (point 13)\n- White \u2192 smart (point 16)\n\nSo yes, Erin is smart. Therefore, the statement \"Erin is not smart\" is false.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: B) False\n\nThe statement \"Erin is not smart\" is false because Erin is nice, which makes her cold, then blue, green, and finally white. Since all white people are smart, Erin must be smart. \n\nThe correct option is: B",
