messages:  [['Please act as a math teacher and reason step by step to solve the logical reasoning problem. Given a context and a question, explain your reasoning process and give the answer with the format "\\nThe correct option is: A/B/C".\n####\n# Context:\nAnne is big. Anne is cold. Anne is furry. Anne is white. Erin is cold. Fiona is round. Gary is smart. All smart things are furry. Big, blue things are round. If Gary is cold then Gary is smart. All blue, furry things are big. If Gary is furry then Gary is blue. Round things are cold. Cold, white things are furry. Round things are blue.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or unknown? Gary is big.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Unknown\n\n# Instruction:\n## Reasoning:', '.']]
