Therefore, Harry is blue.\n\n4. **Applying Rule 1:**\n   - All blue things are rough.\n   - Therefore, Harry is rough.\n\n5. **Applying Rule 8:**\n   - Rough things are kind.\n   - Therefore, Harry is kind.\n\n6. **Applying Rule 5:**\n   - All kind things are furry.\n   - Therefore, Harry is furry.\n\n7. **Conclusion:**\n   - The statement \"Harry is not furry\" is false because Harry is furry.\n\n**Answer:** The correct option is: B) False",
