messages:  [['Please act as a math teacher and reason step by step to solve the logical reasoning problem. Given a context and a question, explain your reasoning process and give the answer with the format "\\nThe correct option is: A/B/C".\n####\n# Context:\nErin is smart. Fiona is quiet. Gary is blue. Gary is kind. Gary is quiet. Gary is red. Harry is smart. If Harry is smart then Harry is kind. Quiet, smart things are blue. If something is green and smart then it is not blue. Kind things are quiet. All blue, green things are smart. Red things are furry. If Harry is smart and Harry is blue then Harry is red.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or unknown? Harry is blue.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Unknown\n\n# Instruction:\n## Reasoning:', '.']]
