he statement \"Fiona is round\" is true.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: A) True\n\nFiona is round because she is rough, and all rough things are round. \n\nStep-by-step explanation:\n\n1. Fiona is red (statement 7) \u2192 Fiona is young (statement 14).\n2. Fiona is quiet (statement 6) and not furry (since only Harry is furry).\n3. Since Fiona is young and not furry, she is kind (statement 15).\n4. Being quiet and kind, Fiona is rough (statement 17).\n5. All rough things are round (statement 11), so Fiona is round.\n\nThe correct option is: A) True",
