final_output:  ['So, the statement is false.\n\nThe correct option is: B\n</think>\n\nThe squirrel is red, as stated in the context. Since all red things are blue, the squirrel is also blue. Additionally, blue, red things are round. Therefore, the squirrel is round. If something is round, it eats the squirrel. Since the squirrel is round, it eats itself. Thus, the statement "The squirrel does not eat the squirrel" is false.\n\nThe correct option is: B', '']
