een and red. From fact 15: All red, green things are furry. Since Fiona is both red and green, she must be furry, which we already concluded. So that\'s consistent.\n\nAlso, from fact 18: Red things are big. So Fiona should be big. But the context doesn\'t mention Fiona\'s size, so that\'s okay because it\'s not necessary for determining her color.\n\nSo putting it all together, Fiona is red. Therefore, the statement "Fiona is red" is true.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: A', '']
