messages:  [['Please act as a math teacher and reason step by step to solve the logical reasoning problem. Given a context and a question, explain your reasoning process and give the answer with the format "\\nThe correct option is: A/B/C".\n####\n# Context:\nAnne is quiet. Bob is not rough. Gary is big. Gary is kind. Gary is rough. Gary is young. Harry is young. All big people are furry. Young people are furry. All quiet, kind people are furry. If Harry is furry and Harry is quiet then Harry is round. Rough, kind people are quiet. Young, rough people are kind. All quiet, furry people are round. Furry people are rough.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or unknown? Gary is young.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Unknown\n\n# Instruction:\n## Reasoning:', '.']]
